# Prisma migration SQL files must never be line-ending-converted — their exact
# bytes are checksummed by `prisma migrate dev`'s shadow-DB validation, and
# Windows' core.autocrlf silently rewriting LF to CRLF on checkout breaks that
# checksum for every migration ever created on a non-Windows machine (or with
# autocrlf off), even though `migrate deploy`/`migrate status` tolerate it fine —
# found 2026-08-19 (F7) when `migrate dev` refused to proceed over exactly this.
backend/prisma/migrations/**/migration.sql -text
